      "name": "Rail Line",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": null,
      "description": "签名组件：轨上一根发丝线，form 写在 CSS 类里——实线在跑、虚线不确定、半高排队、残桩过去、划断停止、钠黄双线等你。颜色由 wave.ts 的名字哈希决定。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-rail-line\" aria-label=\"deploy.production #12 在跑\"><span class=\"ds-stem-slot\"><span class=\"ds-stem is-live\"></span></span><span class=\"ds-rail-tag\">#12</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-rail-line{appearance:none;background:none;border:0;padding:0 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;cursor:pointer;position:relative;font:inherit;color:inherit}.ds-rail-line::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);top:-8px;bottom:-4px;width:44px}.ds-rail-line:focus-visible{outline:1px solid var(--ink,#e7e2d4);outline-offset:4px}.ds-stem-slot{height:132px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:4px}.ds-stem{width:2px;background:var(--wl,var(--ink-mid,#a6a193));transform-origin:bottom}.ds-stem.is-live{height:132px}.ds-stem.is-queued{height:calc(132px*0.42);opacity:.55}.ds-stem.is-dashed{height:132px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,var(--wl,var(--ink-mid,#a6a193)) 0 7px,transparent 7px 12px)}.ds-stem.is-stub{height:18px;opacity:.3}.ds-stem.is-struck{height:18px;opacity:.45;position:relative}.ds-stem.is-struck::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-5px;right:-5px;top:8px;height:1px;background:var(--ink-faint,#928d7f)}.ds-stem.is-waiting{height:132px;background:var(--sodium,#f2d30b);box-shadow:0 0 0 .5px rgba(242,211,11,.35)}.ds-stem.is-notice{height:calc(132px*.75);background:repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,var(--sodium,#f2d30b) 0 7px,transparent 7px 12px)}.ds-rail-tag{margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--ink-faint,#928d7f);white-space:nowrap}.ds-rail-line.is-selected .ds-rail-tag{color:var(--ink,#e7e2d4)}"
    },
