      "description": "决策图版：点轨上一根线，它在那根线正上方绽放；钠色指针钉住所选线，推荐项实墨填充。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-plate\" style=\"--pointer:50%;--pointer-color:var(--sodium,#f2d30b)\"><div class=\"ds-plate-head\"><span class=\"ds-plate-num\">卡片 #7 · 等你决定</span><span class=\"ds-plate-sub\">deploy.production</span></div><div class=\"ds-plate-body\">要删除 3 个旧目录，确认吗？</div><div class=\"ds-plate-meta\"><span>Agent <b>claude-code</b></span><span>用量 <b>12,480 token · $0.31</b></span></div><div class=\"ds-plate-options\"><button class=\"ds-act ds-act-best\">确认删除</button><button class=\"ds-act\">先不动</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-plate{width:min(720px,100%);background:var(--g2,#26292a);border:1px solid var(--hair,#3a3d3e);border-radius:4px;padding:22px 26px 24px;position:relative;color:var(--ink,#e7e2d4);font-size:14px;line-height:1.55}.ds-plate::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:-1px;left:var(--pointer,50%);width:2px;height:14px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--pointer-color,var(--hair,#3a3d3e))}.ds-plate-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:4px}.ds-plate-num{font-size:21px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.02em}.ds-plate-sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-mid,#a6a193);letter-spacing:.03em}.ds-plate-body{margin:10px 0 4px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-plate-meta{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-mid,#a6a193);display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:8px 0 2px}.ds-plate-meta b{font-weight:600}.ds-plate-options{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}.ds-act{font:inherit;min-height:44px;padding:0 20px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--ink-mid,#a6a193);background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#e7e2d4);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .25s ease,color .25s ease,border-color .25s ease}.ds-act:hover{border-color:var(--ink,#e7e2d4)}.ds-act:focus-visible{outline:1px solid var(--ink,#e7e2d4);outline-offset:2px}.ds-act-best{background:var(--ink,#e7e2d4);border-color:var(--ink,#e7e2d4);color:#16181a;font-weight:600}"
